    {
      "id": "key-text",
      "shape": "text",
      "role": "label",
      "face": "body",
      "text": "Blue: Ravel processes. Grey: external participants.\nAn X ends the pictured lifetime after cleanup or reap.\nThe run’s answer goes to the configuration script. The managed process is a later launch.\nIn the Claude example the run exits 0. It sends no end-session result.\nThe later managed process sends the final result prime.\nWith --json, the notice follows the supervision attempt.",
